WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.290
Unit fourteen. My Neighborhood!

2
00:00:04.407 --> 00:00:09.157
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Sophea. Welcome back!

3
00:00:09.207 --> 00:00:12.771
Hi, Teacher Sophea! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.821 --> 00:00:16.585
Today we learn: My Neighborhood. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.701 --> 00:00:21.301
Neighbor. Say it with me. Neighbor!

6
00:00:24.801 --> 00:00:28.084
Street. Say it with me. Street!

7
00:00:31.587 --> 00:00:35.503
Corner. Say it with me. Corner!

8
00:00:38.986 --> 00:00:42.736
Nearby. Say it with me. Nearby!

9
00:00:46.247 --> 00:00:50.497
Sidewalk. Say it with me. Sidewalk!

10
00:00:53.980 --> 00:00:57.780
Traffic. Say it with me. Traffic!

11
00:01:01.292 --> 00:01:04.925
Alley. Say it with me. Alley!

12
00:01:08.438 --> 00:01:12.605
Crossroad. Say it with me. Crossroad!

13
00:01:16.109 --> 00:01:19.593
Block. Say it with me. Block!

14
00:01:23.097 --> 00:01:26.830
Fence. Say it with me. Fence!

15
00:01:30.323 --> 00:01:33.323
Gate. Say it with me. Gate!

16
00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:40.470
Yard. Say it with me. Yard!

17
00:01:43.951 --> 00:01:54.934
Grammar time! There is  or  are + place. Listen. There is a shop on the corner. There are many houses nearby.

18
00:01:54.984 --> 00:02:01.927
Your turn. Say it with me. There is a shop on the corner. There are many houses nearby.

19
00:02:06.654 --> 00:02:11.998
My neighbor lives on the corner of our street. There is often traffic nearby in the morning.

20
00:02:12.048 --> 00:02:13.233
I like this story!

21
00:02:14.121 --> 00:02:19.431
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:19.481 --> 00:02:20.631
Corner!

23
00:02:21.443 --> 00:02:26.890
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:28.090
Alley!

25
00:02:29.051 --> 00:02:36.536
Think and answer. Describe your neighborhood.

26
00:02:36.586 --> 00:02:37.767
Great answer!

27
00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:41.885
This unit's value is Friendliness.

28
00:02:41.935 --> 00:02:43.843
I can show friendliness every day!

29
00:02:44.518 --> 00:02:50.090
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

30
00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:52.034
Bye-bye, friends!

